nents/FilterToolbar.tsx#L13-L146))\n   - Removed `physicsFrozen` and `togglePhysicsFrozen` destructuring from context.\n   - Removed the \"Freeze Physics\" / \"Resume Physics\" toggle button markup and styles from the top navigation bar.\n\n2. [GraphSyncContext.tsx](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T165618-008-wcap/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx) ([`GraphSyncContextType`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T165618-008-wcap/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L8-L27), [`GraphSyncProvider`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T165618-008-wcap/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L31-L150))\n   - Removed `physicsFrozen` and `togglePhysicsFrozen` from [`GraphSyncContextType`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T165618-008-wcap/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L8-L27).\n   - Removed `physicsFrozen` state, `togglePhysicsFrozen` callback, and provider value/dependency references.\n\n3. [GraphCanvas.tsx](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T165618-008-wcap/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx) ([`GraphCanvas`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T165618-008-wcap/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L17-L547))\n   - Decoupled D3 force simulation lifecycle from `render` callback by introducing a mutable `renderRef`.\n   - Restricted simulation `useEffect` dependencies strictly to `[nodes, links]`, preventing simulation resets and repulsive cursor kicks during node hover and single-click selection.\n   - Configured autonomous force simulation damping with `.alphaDecay(0.028)` and `.velocityDecay(0.4)`.\n   - Removed imperative `physicsFrozen` control effect.\n   - Refactored Blueprint Telemetry HUD overlay into an interactive, collapsible accordion supporting collapsed badge (`◈ BLUEPRINT